category: Libs
build-depends: cygport liblua-devel libreadline-devel libusb1.0-devel libxml2-devel lua perl python3-devel swig
sdesc: "Library to control radio transceivers and receivers (utilities)"
ldesc: "The Hamlib project's purpose is to develop flexible and portable shared
libraries that offer a standardized API to control any radio oriented
equipment through a computer interface."
skip:

